    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur uchareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि उचरीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108467",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਿਚਰੀਐ ॥੯੨੯॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam bichareeaai ||929||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Paashsakatanani” add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.929.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੨੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम बिचरीऐ ॥९२९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108468",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਰੁਣਾਇਧ ਨਾਸਨਨਿ ਬਖਾਨਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "barunaidh naasanan bakhaanahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਬਰੁਣਾਇਧ ਨਾਸਨਿਨਿ' (ਬਿਅਸ ਨਦੀ ਦੇ ਸੰਬੰਧ ਵਾਲੀ) (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बरुणाइध नासननि बखानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108469",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਾਨਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh Thaanahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद ठानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108470",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108471",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਕਹਿਜੈ ॥੯੩੦॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam kahijai ||930||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly word “Varunayudh-naashanan”, add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.930.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਕਹੋ ॥੯੩੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम कहिजै ॥९३०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108472",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਲਿਸਨ ਆਯੁਧ ਨਾਮ ਕਹੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jalisan aayudh naam kaheejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਜਲਿਸਨ ਆਯੁਧ' (ਵਰੁਣ ਦਾ ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ) ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जलिसन आयुध नाम कहीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108473",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਦੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh dheejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद दीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108474",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bakhaanahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि बखानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108475",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨਹੁ ॥੯੩੧॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam pramaanahu ||931||",
      "translation": "Saying the word “Jalsin-aayudh” in the beginning, add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.931.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੩੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम प्रमानहु ॥९३१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108476",
      "sourceShabadId": "9565",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੜਿਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aRil ||",
      "translation": "ARIL",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੜਿਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अड़िल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108477",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਪਾਸਿ ਲੈ ਨਾਮ ਨਾਸਨਿਨਿ ਭਾਖੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal paas lai naam naasanin bhaakheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਪਹਿਲਾ) ਪਾਸ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਨਾਮ ਲੈ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਨਾਸਨਿਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल पासि लै नाम नासनिनि भाखीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108478",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਕੈ ਨਾਥ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਪਦ ਰਾਖੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh kai naath bahur padh raakheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਥ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि कै नाथ बहुरि पद राखीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108479",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕਹੁ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh kahu taa ke a(n)t bakhaaneeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद कहु ता के अंति बखानीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108480",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਬੁਧਿ ਪਛਾਨੀਐ ॥੯੩੨॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam subudh pachhaaneeaai ||932||",
      "translation": "Saying all the names of noose (paash) utter the word “Naashnin” and then the words “Jaachar-naath” and recognize all then the words “Jaachar-naath” and recognize all the names of Tupak.932.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਤੁਪਕ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝਣ ॥੯੩੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो सकल तुपक के नाम सुबुधि पछानीऐ ॥९३२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108481",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਾਵਿਨਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਬਖਾਨਨ ਕੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "raavinanee sabadhaadh bakhaanan keejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰਾਵਿਨਨੀ' (ਰਾਵੀ ਨਦੀ ਨੂੰ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੀ ਭੂਮੀ) ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "राविननी सबदादि बखानन कीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108482",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਕੈ ਨਾਥ ਸਬਦ ਪੁਨਿ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh kai naath sabadh pun dheejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਥ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 772,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि कै नाथ सबद पुनि दीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108483",
      "sourceShabadId": "9566",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0018",
