      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਬੀਰ ਪਛਾਨੀਐ ॥੯੩੩॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam subeer pachhaaneeaai ||933||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Raavanani”, add “Jaachar, naath and shatru” at the end and in this way know all the names of Tupak.933.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਭਰਾ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੯੩੩॥",
