    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0772_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਲਹਿ ਲਿਜੈ ॥੯੩੬॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh leh lijai ||936||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Shashi-bhaganan”, add the words “Jaachar-pati-shatru” and in this way know all the names of Tupak.936.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੯੩੬॥",
